<!--
  Codivio sitemap (Phase 3.1).

  Lists only real, currently indexable public pages — the 34 tool pages
  are intentionally excluded (see shared/seo/tools.ts: every tool page is
  noindex today because ToolPage.tsx renders a "coming soon" placeholder,
  not real functionality; a sitemap should only list pages meant to be
  indexed). Update this file when a tool ships real functionality and its
  shared/seo/tools.ts robots entry flips to index,follow.

  Static (not worker-generated) for now, matching robots.txt/llms.txt —
  see DECISIONS.md's "SEO Metadata Architecture" entry for why a dynamic,
  D1-driven sitemap is future work rather than being built here.
-->
